# UI style guide — Zanzibaba Real Estate v2

Source of truth: `assets/branding/design-tokens.json` and `assets/branding/design-tokens.css`.

## Colors

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|--------|
| Navy | `#0A2E73` | Headers, nav, dark sections |
| Navy deep | `#07245A` | Gradients, footer |
| Gold | `#C89B3C` | Accents, CTAs, dividers |
| Ink | `#0F172A` | Body text |
| Muted | `#64748B` | Secondary text |
| Surface | `#F8FAFC` | Section backgrounds |

## Typography

- **Display:** Cormorant Garamond — hero H1, section titles
- **UI:** DM Sans — nav, body, buttons, cards

## Layout

- Mobile-first; max content width ~1280px for text blocks
- Hero: full viewport height, layered photography from `assets/images/hero/`
- Section rhythm: generous vertical padding (`spacing.16`+ from tokens)

## Components (when built)

- Navbar: `navbar-logo.png` or `navbar-compact.png` on scroll
- Offerings grid: icons from `assets/icons/solutions/`
- Footer: `footer-logo.png` on navy background

## Imagery

- Hero: `primary.jpg`, Stone Town set, `hero-zanzibar.png`
- Avoid stock that conflicts with approved set in `assets/images/`

## Accessibility

- Minimum 4.5:1 contrast on body text
- Alt text on all marketing photography
- Focus rings on interactive elements (gold or navy outline)
